### Create an article
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example article",
  "description": "Created with requests.http",
  "content": "Article body",
  "publishAt": 1791590400000
}

### Missing name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Article without a name",
  "publishAt": 1791590400000
}

### Missing publishAt (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Article without a publish date"
}

### Create article: Pagination basics
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pagination basics",
  "description": "An introduction to paginated results",
  "content": "Pagination divides a long list into smaller pages.",
  "publishAt": 1791676800000
}

### Create article: Query parameters
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Query parameters",
  "description": "How clients request a specific page",
  "content": "Limit controls the number of results, while page selects the result window.",
  "publishAt": 1791763200000
}

### Create article: Page size
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Choosing a page size",
  "description": "Keep responses a useful size",
  "content": "A smaller limit can make each response easier to process.",
  "publishAt": 1791849600000
}

### Create article: Result offsets
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Result offsets",
  "description": "Selecting later pages of results",
