### Create article: API clients
POST http://localhost:3000/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "API clients",
  "description": "Working with article endpoints",
  "content": "Clients can use pagination parameters to request just the results they need.",
  "publishAt": 1792022400000
}

### Get first 3 articles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/articles?limit=3&page=1&page=2

### Get next 3 articles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/articles?limit=3&page=2

### Get page 2 with default limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/articles
